  "tags": [
    "Spellslinger",
    "Drain",
    "Legends",
    "Graveyard"
  ],
  "strategy": "Y'shtola, Night's Blessed turns every noncreature spell with mana value 3 or greater into 2 damage to each opponent and 2 life for you, and draws a card at each end step once a player has lost 4 or more life that turn. The deck is built to hit both halves: Papalymo Totolymo pings the table on every noncreature spell, Circle of Power and Transpose leave Wizards that do the same, and Exsanguinate, Syphon Mind and Bastion of Remembrance push a turn's loss past four. The Scions back it up: Alphinaud Leveilleur and Alisaie Leveilleur reward the second spell each turn, G'raha Tia, Scion Reborn pays life into Heroes, Krile Baldesion and Emet-Selch of the Third Seat bring cards back from the graveyard, and Urianger Augurelt plays from exile. Final Judgment, Crux of Fate, Cleansing Nova, Void Rend and Swords to Plowshares answer the board, Torrential Gearhulk and Dig Through Time refuel, and the Job select Equipment arrive with a Hero to wear them.",
